<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
    <main class="w-full">
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="text_and_single_image" data-section-id="pg055_sec001" class="bg-white text-neutral-800"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 pt-8 pb-6 max-sm:px-5"><div class="flex items-start gap-8 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-4"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 pt-4"><div class="flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start"><div class="flex-1 bg-purple-500 px-6 py-3 max-sm:w-full"><h1 class="adt-h1 font-bold text-white text-center max-sm:text-left" data-id="pg055_n0002">Mendime t&#xeb; ndryshme, vendime t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;ta</h1></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-0 flex h-56 w-36 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-b-md rounded-t-md bg-purple-400 max-sm:mt-4 max-sm:h-28 max-sm:w-36"><div class="relative h-24 w-24 max-sm:h-20 max-sm:w-20"><div class="absolute left-0 top-2 h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-white max-sm:h-12 max-sm:w-12"></div><div class="absolute right-0 top-5 h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-white max-sm:h-12 max-sm:w-12"></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-5 max-w-2xl"><h2 class="adt-h2 text-neutral-900" data-id="pg055_n0003">Institucionet dhe vendimet</h2><div aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 h-1 w-80 bg-purple-400 max-sm:w-64"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 pb-8 max-sm:px-5"><div class="mt-4 inline-block bg-yellow-300 px-4 py-1 shadow-sm"><h3 class="adt-h3 text-neutral-900" data-id="pg055_n0004">Situata 2.</h3></div><p class="adt-body mt-4 leading-relaxed text-left"><span data-id="pg055_n0006">P&#xeb;rmes zgjedhjeve, zgjidhen p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;suesit e popullit - deputet&#xeb;t e parlamentit.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0007">Deputet&#xeb;t zgjedhin presidentin a presidenten, i cili/e cila ka funksion p&#xeb;rbashkues.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0008">Ata po ashtu formojn&#xeb; edhe qeverin&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0009">K&#xeb;shtu iu p&#xeb;rgjigj m&#xeb;suesi Andit, kur e pyeti p&#xeb;r deputet&#xeb;t dhe presidentin.</span></p><figure class="mt-5"><img src="images/pg055_im001.png" alt="Seanc&#xeb; n&#xeb; Kuvendin e Republik&#xeb;s s&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s, me deputet&#xeb; t&#xeb; mbledhur n&#xeb; sall&#xeb; dhe foltoren n&#xeb; qend&#xeb;r." data-id="pg055_im001" class="mx-auto w-full h-auto rounded-[2rem] border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm"><figcaption class="adt-caption mt-2 text-center font-semibold text-neutral-800" data-id="pg055_n0011">Kuvendi i Republik&#xeb;s s&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s</figcaption></figure><div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-sm border-l-4 border-purple-300 bg-purple-100"><div class="flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col"><div class="flex-1 p-5 max-sm:p-4"><ul class="m-0 list-none space-y-5 p-0"><li><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 text-neutral-700">&#x2013;</span><div class="flex-1"><p class="adt-body" data-id="pg055_n0015">Si zgjidhet presidenti?</p><label for="item-1" class="sr-only">Si zgjidhet presidenti?</label><textarea id="item-1" data-activity-item="item-1" aria-label="Si zgjidhet presidenti?" class="mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500"></textarea></div></div></li><li><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 text-neutral-700">&#x2013;</span><div class="flex-1"><p class="adt-body"><span data-id="pg055_n0017">Imagjinoni se klasa juaj po voton p&#xeb;r vendet q&#xeb; do t&#x2019;i vizitoni gjat&#xeb; ekskursionit.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0018">Organizoni votimin!</span></p><label for="item-2" class="sr-only">Imagjinoni se klasa juaj po voton p&#xeb;r vendet q&#xeb; do t&#x2019;i vizitoni gjat&#xeb; ekskursionit. Organizoni votimin!</label><textarea id="item-2" data-activity-item="item-2" aria-label="Imagjinoni se klasa juaj po voton p&#xeb;r vendet q&#xeb; do t&#x2019;i vizitoni gjat&#xeb; ekskursionit. Organizoni votimin!" class="mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500"></textarea></div></div></li><li><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 text-neutral-700">&#x2013;</span><div class="flex-1"><p class="adt-body" data-id="pg055_n0020">Pse duhet t&#xeb; respektojm&#xeb; rezultatin e votimit edhe n&#xeb;se nuk fiton zgjedhja jon&#xeb;?</p><label for="item-3" class="sr-only">Pse duhet t&#xeb; respektojm&#xeb; rezultatin e votimit edhe n&#xeb;se nuk fiton zgjedhja jon&#xeb;?</label><textarea id="item-3" data-activity-item="item-3" aria-label="Pse duhet t&#xeb; respektojm&#xeb; rezultatin e votimit edhe n&#xeb;se nuk fiton zgjedhja jon&#xeb;?" class="mt-2 w-full min-h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-purple-500"></textarea></div></div></li></ul></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex w-24 shrink-0 items-start justify-center bg-purple-500 text-white max-sm:h-16 max-sm:w-full max-sm:items-center"><div class="px-4 py-4 font-bold">?</div></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start max-sm:flex-col-reverse"><div class="flex-1 p-4 pr-6 max-sm:p-4 max-sm:pr-4"><p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg055_n0023">Njer&#xeb;zit jetojn&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku dhe p&#xeb;r k&#xeb;t&#xeb; arsye kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r rregulla.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0024">Ato mund t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; rregulla shoq&#xeb;rore, t&#xeb; cilat nuk jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; shkruara, dhe rregulla ligjore, t&#xeb; cilat jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; detyrueshme p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0025">Shteti rregullon jet&#xeb;n e banor&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; nj&#xeb; vendi.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0026">P&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; sa m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; detyrat e tij, ekzistojn&#xeb; institucionet qendrore dhe ato lokale.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0027">Institucionet duhet t&#xeb; kujdesen q&#xeb; k&#xeb;to rregulla t&#xeb; zbatohen nga t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0028">Institucionet qendrore drejtojn&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; vendin, kurse institucionet lokale plot&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; nevojat e banor&#xeb;ve n&#xeb; komuna t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0029">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; njer&#xeb;zit mbi 18 vje&#xe7; kan&#xeb; t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb; t&#xeb; votojn&#xeb;, p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; zgjedhur p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;suesit e tyre n&#xeb; parlament dhe komun&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0030">Parlamenti nxjerr ligje p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;ve, zgjedh qeverin&#xeb; e po ashtu edhe presidentin.</span></p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="h-20 w-24 shrink-0 bg-purple-400 max-sm:h-14 max-sm:w-full"></div></div></div><p class="adt-body mt-10"><span class="font-semibold" data-id="pg055_n0032">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span> <span data-id="pg055_n0033">institucion, vendim, rregull, ligj, komun&#xeb;.</span></p></div></section></div>
